kedo...","de":"Dakedo...","orig":"scenes/reze_2/lines/24.mp3"},{"t":111.634,"end":115.27,"chars":[1],"who":"Denji","text":"Saikin shigoto ga mitomerarete kite sa...","de":"Saikin shigoto ga mitomerarete kite sa...","orig":"scenes/reze_2/lines/25.mp3"},{"t":115.368,"end":118.558,"chars":[1],"who":"Denji","text":"Kanshi ga nakute mo tooku ni ikeru you ni natta shi...","de":"Kanshi ga nakute mo tooku ni ikeru you ni natta shi...","orig":"scenes/reze_2/lines/26.mp3"},{"t":119.149,"end":123.12,"chars":[1],"who":"Denji","text":"Kuso mitai na seikaku no badii no atsukaikata mo dandan wakatte kita.","de":"Kuso mitai na seikaku no badii no atsukaikata mo dandan wakatte kita.","orig":"scenes/reze_2/lines/27.mp3"},{"t":124.437,"end":128.442,"chars":[1],"who":"Denji","text":"Sore ni iya na senpai to mo, yatto nakayoku natte kita n da.","de":"Sore ni iya na senpai to mo, yatto nakayoku natte kita n da.","orig":"scenes/reze_2/lines/28.mp3"},{"t":129.363,"end":132.363,"chars":[1],"who":"Denji","text":"Shigoto no mokuhyou mitee na mon mo mitsukete sa.","de":"Shigoto no mokuhyou mitee na mon mo mitsukete sa.","orig":"scenes/reze_2/lines/29.mp3"},{"t":132.718,"end":135.718,"chars":[1],"who":"Denji","text":"Dandan tanoshiku natte kite n da, ima.","de":"Dandan tanoshiku natte kite n da, ima.","orig":"scenes/reze_2/lines/30.mp3"},{"t":136.645,"end":140.673,"chars":[1],"who":"Denji","text":"Koko de shigoto tsuzukenagara, Reze to au no ja dame na no?","de":"Koko de shigoto tsuzukenagara, Reze to au no ja dame na no?","orig":"scenes/reze_2/lines/31.mp3"},{"t":143.426,"end":146.603,"chars":[2],"who":"NPC","text":"Hanabi taikai, mamonaku hajimarimasu.","de":"Hanabi taikai, mamonaku hajimarimasu.","orig":"scenes/reze_2/lines/32.mp3"},{"t":149.088,"end":150.469,"chars":[0],"who":"Reze","text":"Sokka.","de":"Sokka.","orig":"scenes/reze_2/lines/33.mp3"},{"t":150.922,"end":152.251,"chars":[0],"who":"Reze","text":"Wakatta.","de":"Wakatta.","orig":"scenes/reze_2/lines/34.mp3"},{"t":154.412,"end":15